# Student Performance Prediction System

## Project Overview
The Student Performance Prediction System is a machine learning project that predicts student academic performance based on factors such as study hours, attendance, previous marks, and other academic details.

## Objectives
- Predict student performance using machine learning.
- Identify factors affecting academic results.
- Help students improve their academic performance.
- Support teachers in monitoring student progress.

## Technologies Used
- Python
- Machine Learning
- Pandas
- NumPy
- Scikit-learn
- Matplotlib
- Jupyter Notebook

## Features
- Student data analysis
- Data preprocessing
- Model training and testing
- Performance prediction
- Prediction results and visualization

## Algorithm
The system can use Linear Regression or another suitable machine learning algorithm to predict student scores.

## How to Run
1. Download or clone this repository.
2. Install the required Python libraries.
3. Open the project notebook or Python file.
4. Run the code and enter the student data.
5. View the predicted performance.

